{"id":"at-least","type":"text","x":40,"y":365,"width":400,"height":100,"text":"至少一次成功 → 通过\npass@5 关注能否找到可用解\n前提：能识别并选出正确结果","fontSize":23,"fontFamily":3,"lineHeight":1.5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"transparent","angle":0,"roughness":0,"opacity":100,"seed":100012,"version":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[]},
{"id":"all-pass","type":"text","x":540,"y":365,"width":420,"height":100,"text":"每次都成功 → 不通过\npass^5 关注连续可靠交付\n任何一次失败都会打破全通过","fontSize":23,"fontFamily":3,"lineHeight":1.5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#b91c1c","backgroundColor":"transparent","angle":0,"roughness":0,"opacity":100,"seed":100013,"version":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[]},
{"id":"note","type":"text","x":40,"y":515,"width":920,"height":65,"text":"若每次成功概率 p = 80%，且各次独立：\n至少一次成功为 99.968%；五次全成功为 32.768%。","fontSize":22,"fontFamily":3,"lineHeight":1.5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","angle":0,"roughness":0,"opacity":100,"seed":100014,"version":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[]}
